  "policy": "One replaced component at a time: abs(f +/-1day^-1, +/-1.0027379day^-1, +/-1/365.25day^-1). Parent and alias models use identical nightly complete sample, held years>=20nights, fixed2m/sjitter, no activity or all6linear indicators. Per-period fractional neighborhood=min(.02,.45*period/trainingbaseline), fit on training only. Parent seeds from externally reported already-opened modes. Retrospective conditional prediction, not blind confirmation. Local optimization and one-component aliases only; no exhaustive combinations, eccentric harmonics or GP. Smaller heldchi2 wins; no calibrated probability.",
